  - [ ] Run `hello` now <!-- golem-run golem=hello -->
- `nightly`: Tidy. Wakes: mention; events `issues.opened`; daily. Pays: whoever starts it; unattended runs @lead. Start: comment `@isp-golem-xiv nightly` or tick its run box.
  <!-- golem-last golem=nightly -->
  Last: never run
  - [ ] Run `nightly` now <!-- golem-run golem=nightly -->

## Disabled

- `broken`: owner required with triggers or schedule; invalid schedule

## Talk to golems

- `@isp-golem-xiv`: list the golems here and the seat and model each would use for you
- `@isp-golem-xiv <golem> [instructions]`: run a golem here
- `@isp-golem-xiv stop`: stop the golem run started here
- `@isp-golem-xiv seat`: show your seats and link to registration

